Package: jointBC
Type: Package
Title: Joint Regression for a Binary and a Continuous Outcome
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Prototype", "Author", email = "prototype@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a cross-sectional joint model for one Gaussian continuous
    outcome and one binary outcome using a shared normal latent effect. The
    subject-level likelihood is integrated with Gauss-Hermite quadrature.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
